  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（打ち合わせまで、まだ時間があるな……\r\n少しぶらぶらするか）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサーさんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030140010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、甘奈じゃないか\r\n偶然だな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんは、ここで何してるの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これからユニットの仕事のことで\r\n依頼先の会社と打ち合わせなんだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、プロデューサーさん\r\n甘奈たちのために頑張ってくれてるんだね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈もプロデューサーさんの頑張りに負けないくらい\r\nアイドルのお仕事、頑張っちゃうよ☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう言ってくれると、こっちもますますやる気が湧くな\r\nでも、オフの日はゆっくり休んでくれていいんだからな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だいじょーぶ、オンとオフの切り替えが大事なことは、\r\n甘奈もわかってるから",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな。俺が心配するまでもなかったか\r\nところで、甘奈はここで何をしてたんだ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "雑誌で気になってた服があったから、\r\nショップまで見にきたんだ☆",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも手ぶらってことは、何も買わなかったのか？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん、すっごくかわいー服だったけどね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "お値段の方が……\r\nだから、けっこー悩んだけど買うのはやめといたの",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "オシャレのためなら金を惜しまず、\r\nってわけじゃないんだな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "まぁ、アイドルでお給料はもらってるけど\r\n半分は親に預けてるし……出費はできるだけ抑えたいもん",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020090"
  },
  {
    "select": "本当に\r\nしっかりしてるな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "甘奈の\r\n好みを知りたいな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "イベントで\r\nそれを着よう",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020100,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "んー……そうかな？\r\nでも、そう言ってもらえると嬉しいかも",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "自分ではよくわかんないけど\r\n小さいころから、しっかり者だって言われてるんだよね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈がしっかり者？　なのは、\r\n甜花ちゃんと一緒にいたいって気持ちが強いからかも",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えらいな、甘奈は\r\nちゃんと自立しているよ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、そうかな？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うーん……でもね、プロデューサーさんにだけは\r\n知っててほしいことがあるんだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "しっかり者だからって……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "誰にも甘えないってわけじゃないんだよ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020170,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "さぁーて、それは誰のことでしょー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、誰って……",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ……教えないよ☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020190,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、ねぇ、打ち合わせの時間へーき？\r\nもう行った方がいいんじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、あぁ、そうだな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020200,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "頑張ってきてね\r\n甘奈のプロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020210,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "へぇ、どうして？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈の好みを知っておけば、\r\n仕事で衣装を用意するときの参考にできるからな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020220,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "わぁ、甘奈好みの衣装にしてくれるんだ！\r\nありがとー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020230,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……でもね、それはうれしいけど、アイドルしてると\r\n今まで自分では選ばなかった服を着るじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020240,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈、あれも結構楽しみなんだ☆",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、そういう考え方もあるのか",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020250,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへ、服を誰かに選んでもらうのは楽しいんだよ\r\nプロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、\r\nたしかにそうかもしれないな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020260,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だからね……今度服を選ぶときは、\r\nプロデューサーさんも一緒に、来てくれる？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ分かった……覚えておくな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020270,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん☆\r\n考えておいてね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020280,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そんなのありなの？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、その服を着てイベントとかに出るなら、\r\n必要経費としてなんとかなる",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020290,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うーん……そんな手が……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020300,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……でも、そんなのダメだよ\r\n経費って結局は会社のお金でしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020310,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "無駄遣いはいけません！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "会社の金を無駄遣いか……\r\nそう言われてしまうと……",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020320,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへ、プロデューサーさんは～\r\n甘奈のことを考えてくれてるんだよね？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020330,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それはすっごくうれしいよっ☆",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、ありがとう",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020340,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でも、今回のことは遠慮しておくね☆",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかったよ\r\nなんだか気を遣わせてしまったみたいで悪かった",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020350,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ううん。あ、でも\r\nプロデューサーさんって頼りになるけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020350"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003020360,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "もしかしたら\r\n甘奈がお財布を握ってたほうがいいのかも、ね？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400302/2014003020360"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]